<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2137413654"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1687456452"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="かたちなきもの"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヰ世界情緒"/><amll:meta key="album" value="色彩"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:05.911"><div begin="00:31.429" end="03:51.685"><p begin="00:31.429" end="00:34.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">過ぎ去ってくあなたのかげ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐淡去的你的影子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gi sa 't te ku a na ta no ka ge</span></p><p begin="00:34.884" end="00:37.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">白昼の中見つめて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在白昼之中凝望着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ku chu u no na ka mi tsu me te</span></p><p begin="00:38.313" end="00:43.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">遠くで響く声に心で触れる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用心触碰那在遥远之处响彻的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to o ku de hi bi ku ko e ni ko ko ro de fu re ru</span></p><p begin="00:45.164" end="00:48.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">小さな背にうつるのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那单薄背后所映出的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na se ni u tsu ru no ha</span></p><p begin="00:48.581" end="00:51.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">健やかなふたりの夢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是二人所坚信的梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko ya ka na fu ta ri no yu me</span></p><p begin="00:51.996" end="00:56.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">赴くままに 迷わないように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔赴所向 不再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo mu ku ma ma ni ma yo wa na i yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:58.002" end="01:00.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">ここにはぐくむもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在此孕育的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni ha gu ku mu mo no</span></p><p begin="01:01.664" end="01:05.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">名前はまだない息吹と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还未赋之以名的呼吸和</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ma e ha ma da na i i bu ki to</span></p><p begin="01:05.723" end="01:09.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">覚えているその秘密<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记忆犹新的那个秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo e te i ru so no hi mi tsu</span></p><p begin="01:12.562" end="01:15.475" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">色めく世界どこまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慢慢苏醒的世界无论何处都</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro me ku se ka i do ko ma de mo</span></p><p begin="01:16.457" end="01:18.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">増えていく色彩に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐染斑斓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu e te i ku shi ki sa i ni</span></p><p begin="01:19.403" end="01:23.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">高鳴るほら子どものままに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是满怀期待的孩子一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ka na ru ho ra ko do mo no ma ma ni</span></p><p begin="01:26.311" end="01:29.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">大事な約束の彼方<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在许下重要约定的彼处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i ji na ya ku so ku no ka na ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.724" end="01:32.595" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">柔らかな光を抱いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧拥着柔软的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka na hi ka ri wo da i te</span></p><p begin="01:33.147" end="01:37.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">まっすぐ歩いていけるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">努力向着笔直的前方行进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 's su gu a ru i te i ke ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:40.003" end="01:47.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">指の隙間に願いをひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在指间埋下一个心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu bi no su ki ma ni ne ga i wo hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="01:47.380" end="01:50.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">木漏れ日はただ甘やかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从树叶缝隙撒下的阳光如此甘甜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko mo re bi ha ta da a ma ya ka ni</span></p><p begin="01:50.313" end="01:53.173" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">影法師が永久にゆらり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">影幢幢 无休止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ge bo u shi ga to wa ni yu ra ri</span></p><p begin="01:53.751" end="01:55.297" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">あなたと刻む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">携你镌刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to ki za mu</span></p><p begin="01:55.463" end="01:56.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">かたちなきあい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无形之爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ta chi na ki a i</span></p><p begin="01:57.150" end="02:00.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">しるべとなり道を照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮分叉之路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ru be to na ri mi chi wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="02:00.581" end="02:03.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">そっと息を止めている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悄悄地屏住呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to i ki wo to me te i ru</span></p><p begin="02:04.021" end="02:06.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">思い出の中深く落ち<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深深地坠入回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i de no na ka fu ka ku o chi</span></p><p begin="02:07.414" end="02:12.911" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">ひび割れた痛みに密か問いかける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着裂痕之伤悄悄发问</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi wa re ta i ta mi ni hi so ka to i ka ke ru</span></p><p begin="02:14.277" end="02:17.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">繋がった手は熱を帯び<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵起的指尖传来暖流</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na ga 't ta te ha ne tsu wo o bi</span></p><p begin="02:17.708" end="02:20.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">浮かぶあの日の言葉達<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那日的话语浮上心头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ka bu a no hi no ko to ba ta chi</span></p><p begin="02:21.136" end="02:25.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">あふれ出してく気持ちをほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看啊 这满溢而出的思绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re da shi te ku ki mo chi wo ho ra</span></p><p begin="02:27.177" end="02:30.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">旅立ちの朝には<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在踏上旅途的清晨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bi da chi no a sa ni ha</span></p><p begin="02:31.010" end="02:34.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">瞳に映る世界が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那映于双瞳的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to mi ni u tsu ru se ka i ga</span></p><p begin="02:34.851" end="02:42.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">眩しくありますように 祈って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈愿它 耀眼夺目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu shi ku a ri ma su yo u ni i no 't te</span></p><p begin="02:44.322" end="02:49.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">届けようただ声を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让这声音传达到吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to do ke yo u ta da ko e wo</span></p><p begin="02:52.030" end="02:55.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">いつか どこか遠くに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是终有一日 在遥远的某处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka do ko ka to o ku ni</span></p><p begin="02:56.923" end="03:00.049" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">消えていってしまっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐的消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te i 't te shi ma 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:02.292" end="03:05.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">大丈夫だよ知ってるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也没关系的 我知道哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i jo u bu da yo shi 't te ru yo</span></p><p begin="03:06.079" end="03:08.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">続いてくいつまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">持续下去直到永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu du i te ku i tsu ma de mo</span></p><p begin="03:09.135" end="03:13.124" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">月が僕らを見放しても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使月亮对我们视而不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ki ga bo ku ra wo mi ha na shi te mo</span></p><p begin="03:16.055" end="03:23.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ねえ きいていてわたしね すきよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 听我说哦 我喜欢你哟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ki i te i te wa ta shi ne su ki yo</span></p><p begin="03:24.992" end="03:27.032" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">街灯り掠める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">街明掠过似流萤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma chi a ka ri ka su me ru</span></p><p begin="03:27.161" end="03:28.735" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">浅い眠りに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浅浅地睡去 就把那冰冷的伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa i ne mu ri ni hi to ri hi e ta ki zu</span></p><p begin="03:28.854" end="03:30.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">ひとり冷えた傷<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就把那冰冷的伤</span></p><p begin="03:31.271" end="03:32.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">閉じ込めた明日に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留给闭锁的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ji ko me ta a su ni</span></p><p begin="03:33.161" end="03:35.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">背を押す体温が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">推着我向前的体温</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se wo o su ta i o n ga</span></p><p begin="03:35.278" end="03:37.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">まるで祝福の開花<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就好像绽放的祝福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de shu ku fu ku no ka i ka</span></p><p begin="03:38.493" end="03:41.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">あなたの隣で眠ること<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你身边熟睡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta no to na ri de ne mu ru ko to</span></p><p begin="03:41.716" end="03:44.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">あなたと笑い合ったこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一同欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to wa ra i a 't ta ko to</span></p><p begin="03:45.124" end="03:48.424" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">送る言葉は少ないけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然能赠予你的话语少之又少</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ku ru ko to ba ha su ku na i ke re do</span></p><p begin="03:48.595" end="03:51.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ずっとそばで歌を歌おう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但会在你身边一直歌唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to so ba de u ta wo u ta o u</span></p></div></body></tt>